<view class="screen has-bottom"><view wx:if="{{state.demo}}" class="mode-banner">本机演示 · 可以切换演示身份体验留言</view><view wx:if="{{state.offline}}" class="mode-banner">当前显示手机缓存，联网后下拉刷新。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box">{{error}}<button class="link" bindtap="refresh">重新打开</button></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在打开这段回忆…</view><block wx:if="{{entry}}"><view class="card detail-paper"><view class="between"><view class="row"><view class="avatar mini">{{entry.initial}}</view><view><view class="author-name">{{entry.authorName}}</view><view class="date-label">{{entry.date}} · {{entry.timeLabel}}</view></view></view><button wx:if="{{entry.mine}}" class="link" bindtap="edit">编辑</button></view><view wx:if="{{entry.title}}" class="detail-title">{{entry.title}}</view><view class="post-body">{{entry.body}}</view><view class="detail-images"><view wx:for="{{entry.images}}" wx:key="id"><image lazy-load="true" aria-label="回忆照片，第 {{index + 1}} 张" wx:if="{{item.url}}" src="{{item.url}}" mode="widthFix" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="preview"/><view wx:else class="notice">这张照片暂时无法打开，下拉刷新后重试。</view></view></view><view class="post-footer"><text>这个瞬间，只有我们懂。</text><button class="post-action {{entry.liked ? 'liked' : ''}}" bindtap="like"><image class="action-icon" src="{{entry.liked ? '/assets/icon-heart-active.png' : '/assets/icon-heart.png'}}"/>{{entry.likedBy.length}}</button></view></view><view class="section between"><view class="title editorial">留给 TA 的悄悄话</view><text class="subtle">{{entry.comments.length}} 条</text></view><view class="card comments section"><view wx:if="{{!entry.comments.length}}" class="comment-empty">还没有留言，和 TA 说句话吧。</view><view wx:for="{{entry.comments}}" wx:key="id" class="comment"><view class="between"><text class="author-name">{{item.authorName}}</text><text class="date-label">{{item.timeLabel}}</text></view><view class="comment-body">{{item.body}}</view></view></view><view class="fixed-bottom comment-form"><input aria-label="给另一半的留言" placeholder-style="color:#766962" value="{{comment}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="给 TA 留句话…" confirm-type="send" bindconfirm="comment"/><button bindtap="comment" loading="{{sending}}" disabled="{{sending || state.offline}}">发送</button></view></block></view>
